# Wind Tunnel .gitignore
# Covers what this project uses or plans to use: Python analysis, microcontroller firmware
# (Arduino / PlatformIO / CMake), CAD exports, lab photos and videos.
# Data policy (what is committed vs. stored externally): see data/README.md and DECISIONS.md.

# --- Secrets and private configuration (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.*
*credentials*.json

# --- Claude Code personal files (shared skills and settings.json ARE committed) ---
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
CLAUDE.local.md

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

# --- Microcontroller firmware build output ---
# (No blanket `build/` rule: in this project "build" may mean the physical tunnel build.)
.pio/
cmake-build-*/
*.elf
*.hex
*.map
*.uf2

# --- Videos: too large for Git. Keep originals in external storage and reference them
#     from docs/data_catalog.md (path or link). See DECISIONS.md D-004. ---
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.MP4
*.MOV

# --- Reference PDFs over 25 MB: kept locally, listed in resources/README.md (D-004) ---
resources/Barlow1999_low-speed-wind-tunnel-testing-3rd-ed.pdf
resources/Ewald1998_wind-tunnel-wall-correction-AGARD-AG-336.pdf

# --- Local scratch space (never committed) ---
scratch/
tmp/

# --- CAD / Office autosave, backup and lock files ---
~$*
*.FCBak
*.bak
*.tmp

# --- OS, sync client and editor clutter ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.tmp.driveupload/
.tmp.drivedownload/
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
